  "content": "Adversaries are already gearing up for \"Q-Day\" with \"harvest now, decrypt later\" attacks  — where they siphon off encrypted data with plans to crack the encryption when quantum computers become available. So forward-thinking enterprises are already conducting crypto-agility assessments, inventorying where encryption is used across their environments, and planning migration paths to quantum-resistant algorithms.",
